### Ranking explanations for World Cup Top 10
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ranking/explanations?season=2026&competition_id=350&rules_version_id=4&scope=world_cup&limit=10&use_total=true

### Player explanation
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/players/1206425/explanation?season=2026&competition_id=350&rules_version_id=4&scope=world_cup&use_total=true

### Generate deterministic/fallback explanations
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/admin/ranking-explanations/generate
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: change-me

{
  "season": "2026",
  "competition_id": 350,
  "rules_version_id": 4,
  "scope": "world_cup",
  "limit": 10,
  "force": true,
  "use_total": true
}
